{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>全球首富馬斯克的太空探索科技公司SpaceX上周五（13日）首次測試重型運載火箭「星艦」（Starship）全箭回收，火箭底部的推進器未能按計劃返回發射塔，已濺落海面［報道詳情］。「星艦」主體則於上周六（14日）返回地球，並由發射塔機械臂回收。這是「星艦」首次由發射塔機械臂回收。（路透社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T05:15:57.914422+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:30:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T00:43:23.367981+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T05:09:32.243161+00:00","content_hash":"51905d6e501485c6c8239eaf952405cdd03b5a3c99aaabc8caf91e696a614eec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}